          "worked": "At an $x$-intercept, $y=0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}(x-3)^2-2&=0\\\\(x-3)^2&=2\\\\x-3&=\\pm\\sqrt2\\\\x&=3\\pm\\sqrt2\\end{align*}$$",
